<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1523">
  <meta name="description" content="One birthday. A party of adventurers. Help Leo complete 38 quests across his favourite RPGs. Join the LEVEL 38 adventure.">
  <title>LEVEL 38 — Join Leo's party</title>
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/level38/Silkscreen-Regular.ttf" as="font" type="font/ttf" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/level38.css">
  <script defer src="/level38/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
  <script defer src="/js/level38/common.js"></script>
  <script defer src="/js/level38/experience.js"></script>
  <script defer src="/js/level38/public.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="level38 l38-public">
  <a class="l38-skip" href="#adventure">Skip to the adventure</a>
  <main class="l38-shell" id="adventure">
    <nav class="l38-nav" aria-label="Site">
      <a class="l38-brand" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> LEO NIFELHEIM <span class="l38-nav-divider">/</span> <span>LV.38</span></a>
      <div><a href="#quest-log">Quest journal</a><a href="#voting" id="vote-nav" class="<%= state.polls.some(p => p.status === 'OPEN') ? 'is-open' : '' %>"><%= state.polls.some(p => p.status === 'OPEN') ? 'Vote now ·' : 'Vote' %></a><a href="#party">Your party</a></div>
    </nav>
    <header class="l38-hero">
      <div class="l38-hero-copy">
        <p class="l38-eyebrow"><span class="l38-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> THE BIRTHDAY ADVENTURE</p>
        <h1>LEVEL <span>38</span><span class="l38-title-star" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></h1>
        <p class="l38-intro">One birthday. A whole party of adventurers.</p>
        <p>Help Leo complete 38 quests across his favourite RPGs.<br class="l38-desktop-break"> Follow the journey. Choose what happens next.</p>
        <div class="l38-hero-links"><a class="l38-button" href="#quest-log">EXPLORE QUESTS <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><span class="l38-small">Everyone has a place in the party.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="l38-landscape"><img src="/img/level38/world.svg" alt="A little hilltop castle beneath a golden moon, with a winding path through the mountains." width="960" height="440"><span>YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE IS WAITING.</span></div>
    </header>
    <section class="l38-progress-panel l38-panel" aria-label="Event progress">
      <div class="l38-progress-heading"><div><p class="l38-eyebrow">THE ROAD TO LEVEL 38</p><h2 id="progress-text"><%= state.event.completed %> / <%= state.event.target %> quests completed</h2></div><span id="journey-label" class="l38-tag"><%= state.event.completed >= state.event.target ? 'TARGET REACHED' : 'ADVENTURE IN PROGRESS' %></span></div>
      <progress id="progress" class="l38-sr-only" value="<%= state.event.completed %>" max="<%= state.event.target %>" aria-labelledby="progress-text"></progress>
      <div id="progress-segments" class="l38-segments" aria-hidden="true"><% for(let i = 0; i < state.event.target; i++) { %><span class="<%= i < state.event.completed ? 'is-complete' : '' %>"></span><% } %></div>
      <div class="l38-progress-foot"><span>Every quest brings us closer.</span><span id="progress-remaining"><%= Math.max(0, state.event.target - state.event.completed) %> TO GO <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></span></div>
    </section>
    <div class="l38-adventure-grid">
      <div class="l38-main-column">
        <section class="l38-current-game l38-panel" aria-labelledby="current-game-label">
          <div class="l38-game-emblem" aria-hidden="true">⚔</div>
          <div><p class="l38-eyebrow" id="current-game-label">NOW EXPLORING</p><h2 id="current-game"><%= state.games.find(game => game.id === state.event.currentGameId)?.title || 'Between adventures' %></h2><p class="l38-small">Leo's current adventure · chosen live</p></div>
          <a href="#active-quests" class="l38-game-arrow" aria-label="Go to active objectives">↘</a>
        </section>
        <section id="active-quests" class="l38-active-panel l38-panel" aria-labelledby="active-heading">
          <div class="l38-section-heading"><h2 id="active-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span> Current objectives</h2><span id="active-count" class="l38-tag"><%= state.quests.filter(q => q.status === 'ACTIVE').length %> ACTIVE</span></div>
          <div id="active-board"><% const active = state.quests.filter(q => q.status === 'ACTIVE'); for(const quest of active) { %><%- include('quest-card', {quest, state}) %><% } %><% if(!active.length) { %><p class="l38-empty">A moment at the campfire.<br>Leo's next objective will appear here.</p><% } %></div>
        </section>
        <section id="voting" class="l38-voting-section" aria-labelledby="voting-heading">
          <div class="l38-section-heading"><h2 id="voting-heading"><span aria-hidden="true">▸</span> The party decides</h2><span class="l38-small">YOUR VOICE, OUR ADVENTURE</span></div>
          <div id="poll-board">
            <% for(const poll of state.polls) { %><section class="l38-panel l38-poll" data-status="<%= poll.status %>"><p class="l38-eyebrow">ROUND <%= poll.number %> · <%= poll.status %></p><h3><%= poll.title %></h3><% for(const option of poll.options) { %><p><%= option.label %> — <%= option.votes %></p><% } %><% if(poll.effectiveWinnerId) { %><p class="l38-result">Winner: <%= poll.options.find(o => o.id === poll.effectiveWinnerId)?.label %></p><% } %></section><% } %>
            <% if(!state.polls.length) { %><div class="l38-panel l38-empty"><span class="l38-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">?</span><h3>The next choice is just ahead.</h3><p>When a vote opens, choose Leo's next move right here.</p></div><% } %>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <aside id="party" class="l38-party-column" aria-label="Your party membership">
        <section class="l38-party-panel l38-panel">
          <p class="l38-eyebrow">THERE'S ROOM FOR ONE MORE</p><h2>Your place in the party</h2>
          <div class="l38-identity"><div id="viewer-sprite" class="l38-avatar-slot" aria-hidden="true"><span>?</span></div><div><strong id="viewer-name">Wandering adventurer</strong><span id="viewer-class">Your story starts here</span></div></div>
          <p id="viewer-status">Watch the adventure, or pick a name and join the party.</p>
          <button id="join-open" type="button" disabled>JOIN THE PARTY <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          <form id="join-form" hidden aria-labelledby="join-heading">
            <h3 id="join-heading">Choose your player name</h3>
            <label for="nickname">Player name</label><input id="nickname" name="nickname" minlength="2" maxlength="48" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="e.g. Garnet" required>
            <p class="l38-small">One random class. Yours for this adventure. All party members have an equal vote.</p>
            <button type="submit">Join party</button><button class="l38-secondary" id="join-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button>
          </form>
          <p class="l38-small l38-party-note">No account needed. Your class stays with this browser.</p>
          <div id="party-welcome" class="l38-party-welcome" role="status" hidden><p class="l38-eyebrow">NEW PARTY MEMBER</p><strong id="welcome-name"></strong><span id="welcome-class"></span><button type="button" id="welcome-dismiss" class="l38-secondary">Onward!</button></div>
        </section>
        <section class="l38-guide-panel l38-panel" aria-label="How the adventure works"><p class="l38-eyebrow">A SMALL GUIDE TO A BIG NIGHT</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Follow the quest</strong><p>Leo plays. We share the journey.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Choose the next move</strong><p>Vote whenever the party is called.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Reach level 38 together</strong><p>38 victories. One birthday to remember.</p></div></li></ol></section>
        <div class="l38-secret-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div><strong>Some paths are still hidden.</strong><p id="secret-count"><%= state.secretCount %> secret quests waiting to be revealed.</p></div></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p id="message" class="l38-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <section id="quest-log" class="l38-journal" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
      <div class="l38-section-heading"><div><p class="l38-eyebrow">EVERY ADVENTURE HAS A STORY</p><h2 id="journal-heading">The quest journal</h2></div><span id="journal-count" class="l38-small"><%= state.quests.length %> KNOWN QUESTS</span></div>
      <div class="l38-log-toolbar"><label for="quest-game">Adventure<select id="quest-game"><option value="all">All games</option><option value="current">Current game</option><% for(const game of state.games) { %><option value="<%= game.id %>"><%= game.title %></option><% } %></select></label><label for="quest-status">Quest status<select id="quest-status"><option value="all">All statuses</option><% for(const status of ['ACTIVE','AVAILABLE','COMPLETED','LOCKED','FAILED','SKIPPED','SECRET']) { %><option value="<%= status %>"><%= status[0] + status.slice(1).toLowerCase() %></option><% } %></select></label><label for="quest-search">Find a quest<input type="search" id="quest-search" placeholder="Search the journal" maxlength="100"></label></div>
      <div id="quest-board"><div class="l38-grid"><% for(const quest of state.quests) { %><%- include('quest-card', {quest, state}) %><% } %></div></div>
      <p id="quest-filter-status" class="l38-small" role="status"></p>
      <div id="secret-placeholder" class="l38-secret-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">?</span><div><h3>Undiscovered quests</h3><p>Some stories are best kept secret. New paths will appear when Leo reveals them.</p></div><strong><%= state.secretCount %> HIDDEN</strong></div>
    </section>
    <footer class="l38-footer"><span>✦ LEVEL 38 <span class="l38-small">A birthday adventure by Leo Nifelheim.</span></span><span id="connection" role="status">Connecting to the party…</span><a href="/level38/control">Operator control ↗</a></footer>
    <noscript><p>Read the quest journal above. Enable JavaScript to join, vote, and follow live updates.</p></noscript>
  </main>
  <div id="event-toast" class="l38-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
  <div id="level-up" class="l38-level-up" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><canvas id="fireworks" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div class="l38-level-up-copy"><p>✦ THE PARTY DID IT ✦</p><h2>LEVEL UP!</h2><h3>LEO REACHED LV.38</h3><p id="celebration-progress">38 / 38 QUESTS COMPLETED</p><span>One legendary birthday. Thanks for being part of it.</span><button type="button" id="celebration-dismiss">Back to the adventure</button></div></div>
</body>
</html>
